msgstr ":guilabel:`Proxy status`: Csak DNS"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:171
msgid "Define a redirect rule to permanently redirect (301) your naked domain (e.g., `yourdomain.com`) to both `http://` and `https://` by going to :menuselection:`Rules --> Create rule --> Products`, and clicking :guilabel:`Create a Rule` under :guilabel:`Redirect Rules`:"
msgstr "Állítson be egy átirányítási szabályt, hogy véglegesen átirányítsa (301) a csupasz domaint (pl. `yourdomain.com`) mind `http://`, mind `https://` címre az alábbi útvonalon: :menuselection:`Rules --> Create rule --> Products`, majd kattintson a :guilabel:`Create a Rule` gombra a :guilabel:`Redirect Rules` alatt:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:175
msgid "Enter any :guilabel:`Rule name`."
msgstr "Adjon meg bármilyen :guilabel:`Rule name`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:176
msgid "Under the :guilabel:`If incoming requests match...` section, select :guilabel:`Custom filter expression` and use the following configuration:"
msgstr "A :guilabel:`If incoming requests match...` szakasz alatt válassza a :guilabel:`Custom filter expression` lehetőséget, és használja a következő konfigurációt:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:179
